<p>NOTE: In the quarter ended June 30, 1997, the company said it recorded special charges before tax totalling $11.6 million for costs related to the consolidation of three of its pharmaceucitcal distribution facilities into other existing facilties, a sales force restructuring program and certain executive management changes.</p>
